sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AC as AuthController / AdminUserController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant UR as UserRepository
    participant DB as MySQL (auth_db)

    Note over FE,DB: Get User Profile
    FE->>GW: GET /api/auth/me + Bearer Token
    GW->>AC: Forward with X-Headers
    AC->>AS: me(principal)
    AS->>UR: findById(userId)
    UR->>DB: SELECT FROM users
    DB-->>UR: User
    AS-->>AC: ProfileResponse
    AC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Profile data

    Note over FE,DB: Admin Update Role
    FE->>GW: PATCH /api/auth/admin/users/{id}/role
    GW->>GW: Validate JWT + ADMIN role
    GW->>AC: Forward
    AC->>AS: updateRole(id, newRole)
    AS->>UR: findById(id)
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    AS->>UR: save(user with new role)
    UR->>DB: UPDATE users SET role=?
    AS-->>AC: UserResponse
    AC-->>GW: 200 OK
    GW-->>FE: Updated user

    Note over FE,DB: Internal User Fetch (Feign)
    participant NS as Notification Service
    NS->>GW: GET /api/auth/internal/users/{id}
    Note right of GW: Internal path bypass
    GW->>AC: Forward
    AC->>AS: getUserById(id)
    AS->>UR: findById(id)
    UR->>DB: SELECT
    AS-->>AC: UserResponse
    AC-->>NS: User data (email, name)
